ailed",shortPrompt:"Build a habit tracker",shortPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.habitTrackerShort",roles:["student","other"]},{logo:t.WebsiteSuggestionIcon,prompt:"Let customers book me without paying for booking software",promptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.takeBookings",detailedPrompt:"Hey Replit! Build a booking page that uses my real availability and sends confirmation emails. Add a day view for my phone.",detailedPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.takeBookingsDetailed",shortPrompt:"Take bookings myself",shortPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.takeBookingsShort",roles:["business-owner","marketing-sales","business-ops","other"]},{logo:t.DesignSuggestionIcon,prompt:"Build a mood board I can drop references into",promptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.moodBoard",detailedPrompt:"Hey Replit! Build a mood board where I can add and rearrange references. Extract a color palette and create a client share link.",detailedPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.moodBoardDetailed",shortPrompt:"Build a mood board",shortPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.moodBoardShort",roles:["designer"]},{logo:t.MobileSuggestionIcon,prompt:"Design a mobile screen flow and make it clickable",promptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.mobileFlow",detailedPrompt:"Hey Replit! Design a clickable mobile flow from onboarding to the main task. Wire up each tap so I can test the experience.",detailedPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.mobileFlowDetailed",shortPrompt:"Design a mobile flow",shortPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.mobileFlowShort",roles:["designer","product-manager"]},{logo:t.DataVizSuggestionIcon,prompt:"Look at my data and tell me what is interesting in it",promptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.exploreData",detailedPrompt:"Hey Replit! Analyze my data and explain the patterns worth knowing. Flag suspicious values and support each finding with a chart.",detailedPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.exploreDataDetailed",shortPrompt:"Find what is interesting",shortPromptIntlId:"home.chat.suggestion.exploreData